{"about":["Experience Sly 3: Honor Among Thieves™ originally released on the PlayStation®2 console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters. The thieving gang returns for its greatest heist ever! Your favorite characters return from Sly 2: Band of Thieves™ as well as new playable specialists like Carmelita Fox and the Guru. This title has been converted from the PlayStation®2 version to the PlayStation®4 and PlayStation®5 consoles and provides newly added features. Consequently, there may be times where the title plays differently from the PlayStation®2 version, or where some features may cause the title to not function properly. This version does not support the PlayStation®2 console’s peripherals, therefore some functionality may not be available."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/821e0410c3752210dcb3c57ab570862316f57860c549453d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/821e0410c3752210dcb3c57ab570862316f57860c549453d.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/099c6868402d7d1af68e7e14580c088c1754de309ce6a4e7.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/099c6868402d7d1af68e7e14580c088c1754de309ce6a4e7.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/b6e0810c77f633be781c2e873f046e2c29677af123ef1eb5.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/b6e0810c77f633be781c2e873f046e2c29677af123ef1eb5.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/3553af29d3bbae54b56f0d02fc41ce2f3466ba217522cf70.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/3553af29d3bbae54b56f0d02fc41ce2f3466ba217522cf70.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2